      "observed_public_status": "completed",
      "answer": "### Annual Leave Policy Overview\nUnder the Annual Leave Policy:\n* **Entitlement:** Eligible full-time employees accrue 20 days of paid annual leave per completed year of service, with part-time employees accruing a proportional entitlement based on their working hours.\n* **Carry-Over & Management:** Unused leave carries over into the next calendar year. Managers cannot informally reduce an accrued balance, though employees with high balances may be asked to establish a leave plan.\n* **Portal Balances:** Leave balances are tracked in hours within the portal, and these recorded balances determine whether a leave request can be supported.\n\n---\n\n### Your Current Annual Leave Balance\n* **Annual Leave:** **48 hours** (as of August 24, 2026)",
